{% set examples = {
  production: 'Give your producers one place to share the run of show, assign the crew and check in guests. When a cue changes, the people running the event can work from the same schedule.',
  corporate: 'Your team can manage RSVPs, guest check-in, vendor handoffs and the show schedule in one workspace. The front desk can see who has arrived while the production team follows the program.',
  activation: 'Give your booth team its schedule and deliverables, record visitor opt-ins and follow up with the people who agreed to hear from your brand.',
  nonprofit: 'Your foundation can manage RSVPs, check in guests and companions individually, and coordinate volunteers and sponsor benefits. Between fundraisers, keep using the agreed tools for donations, volunteer sign-ups and sponsorships.',
